      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, it\u0027s not strictly required. We need either this change or the tweaked drivers (or both) on dedede. Mostly uploading this as an option to consider. I\u0027m fine sitting on it for now. \n\nWhy not override keyscan_config?:\nThis approach allows individual boards to override keyscan_config, while still enforcing a minimum. Baseboard and board cannot both override keyscan_config. I guess we could flip this to overriding keyscan_config in the baseboard, and let individual boards override at runtime as needed. BTW, this approach was inspired by keyscan_config used in nissa.",
